WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.720
Hey guys! What we're going to see now is a&nbsp;
little bit of switching between me and Katie.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:10.080
We share three languages, more than three languages&nbsp;
and we want to just show you how it is to switch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:15.920
from one language to the other. It's just something&nbsp;for the fun of it. We hope you're going to like it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:21.520
Okay Katie so what we're going to do now like for&nbsp;
30 seconds one minute two minutes i don't know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:26.160
we're just gonna have a conversation where we&nbsp;have to switch and the only rule is that you have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:30.640
to reply in a language that is different from&nbsp;the language I'm currently speaking in, right?

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.359
Katie (in Italian): I am scared!

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:36.474
Luca (in French): so, where are right now?

00:00:36.474 --> 00:00:38.122
Katie: we are in Milan..

00:00:38.122 --> 00:00:40.502
Luca (in Italian): I have never been to Milan, it is the first time

00:00:40.502 --> 00:00:43.663
Katie (in French): oh! I myself live in Milan

00:00:43.663 --> 00:00:44.917
Luca (in Italian): how long have you been living in Milan?

00:00:44.917 --> 00:00:48.832
Katie (in French): 10 years, more or less

00:00:48.832 --> 00:00:49.681
Luca: Wow, it's been a long time!

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.240
Why did you decid to go to Milan?

00:00:52.240 --> 00:01:00.513
Katie (in Italian): Because I had a friend who used to live in Milan and...

00:01:00.513 --> 00:01:01.352
Luca (in French): and that's it!

00:01:01.352 --> 00:01:02.706
Katie (in Italian): yes, exactly!

00:01:02.706 --> 00:01:05.320
Luca (in French): You just went for it! I'll go to Milan and stay there! 

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:06.506
Luca (in Italian): do you like Milan?

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:09.000
Katie: yes

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:13.049
Luca (in Italian): we are getting confused!

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:20.480
Katie: Yes I like i like Milan, I didn't like it at first, in fact i was only supposed to come on holiday um

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:24.560
but then after a while i really like the lifestyle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:27.280
because it feels quite small&nbsp;
even though it's a big city

