Luca (in French): And where do you come from exactly, where were you born?

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:38.849
Katie (in Italian): I am English! I can't reply in French cause you just spoke French!

00:01:38.849 --> 00:01:43.560
Luca (in Italian): you are right. Damn, I just spoke Italian! What a mess!

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:46.627
Luca (in English): so you were born in..where exactly?

00:01:46.627 --> 00:01:54.218
