00:01:54.218 --> 00:01:57.253
Luca (in Italian): Ok, do you like Sheffield? Would go back and live there?

00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:05.120
Katie: I like it but I wouldn't go back to live&nbsp;because I love languages and they don't speak so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:09.000
it's it's harder to speak foreign&nbsp;
languages in Sheffield, not impossible but harder

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:13.120
Luca (in Italian): It is true! On the other hand is it possible to speak many languages in Milan?

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:20.916
Katie (in French): I can speak Italian for example, that's easy to do that 

00:02:20.916 --> 00:02:30.000
What about you? You live in Rome..do you speak a lot of languages every day?

00:02:30.347 --> 00:02:32.428
Luca (in Italian): it is true, you are well informed, 

00:02:32.428 --> 00:02:36.817
I speak between 6 and 10 languages (every day), 10 languages  

00:02:36.817 --> 00:02:41.753
on a good day but it is rare but generally, I speak between 4 and 6 languages 

00:02:41.753 --> 00:02:46.929
at work and in my life in general. What about you? How many languages do you speak on a daily basis?

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:51.680
Katie: Probably just Italian on&nbsp;
a day-to-day basis. In fact, &nbsp;

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:53.854
my languages are a little bit rusty at the moment

00:02:53.854 --> 00:02:59.935
Luca (in French): so you don't speak English, you don't speak it with your boyfriend, your friends in Milan..

00:02:59.935 --> 00:03:02.570
Katie (in Italian): It is true! I speak English as well, you are right

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.480
Luca (in Italian): It is difficult not to speak English..

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:09.451
Katie (in French): Yes, it is true, it is quite difficult!

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:17.760
Luca: So this was a demonstration how to switch it, was&nbsp;slightly challenging.. no? Katie: Yeah Luca: ..not to get confused&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:24.080
but you get the idea. This is no magic. it's&nbsp;really easy to change if.. it's a skill you develop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:28.960
so it's something that you can easily develop. It's difficult to say something different&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:33.920
