manage if you have three different people and you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:38.800
stick to one conversation at a time.. you know don't&nbsp;
constantly switch i think it's manageable right?

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:42.720
Katie: yeah yeah Luca: the last thing I wanted to&nbsp;
say is that everything is possible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:47.680
